Go from a quick prompt to production apps and agents with the Gemini API.
Tackle complex coding and multimodal reasoning with Gemini, or hand multi-step
work to a managed agent. Stream voice and video with the Live API, or generate
images with Nano Banana, video with Gemini Omni, and music with Lyria.

### Python

    from google import genai

    client = genai.Client()

    interaction = client.interactions.create(
        model="gemini-4-argon",
        input="Explain how AI works in a few words"
    )

    print(interaction.output_text)

### JavaScript

